    "body": "Problem:\r\nClaude and friends love to sprinkle advertisements in commit messages.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nAllow a generic \"AI-assisted\" token only.\r\nReject useless mentions of AI services, sessions, and other bullshit.\r\n\r\n\r\nNone of this shit is acceptable:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\r\n  Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\r\n  Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\r\n  Co-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>\r\n  Helped-by: Claude\r\n  Assisted-by: Cursor\r\n  Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AdAjbSdp1orj2EHVw6U1JV\r\n  Codex-Thread: abc123\r\n  https://claude.ai/code/session_01AdAjbSdp1orj2EHVw6U1JV\r\n  🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\r\n  Generated with Amp\r\n  Supported by AI.\r\n  AI-assisted: Claude\r\n  AI-assisted: claude-opus-5\r\n```\r\n\r\nDisclosure: This PR was authored by an sapient turnip 🫜, raised in\r\nmoist, fluffy soil, tilled by the blurry wings of a hummingbird.\r\n\r\n",
